cher for even more powerful explosive ammunition.","abilities":["After two attacks, the next attack deals Splash damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":600,"def":350,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"dublinn_sniffer_hound_pro":{"slug":"dublinn_sniffer_hound_pro","name":"Dublinn Sniffer Hound Pro","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Sniffer Hound Pro.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An organism controlled by the Dublinn forces, they are stronger in combat than the average Hound. They were originally purchased from a mercenary group, and have undergone training for a longer period. Equipped with a refractive mask crafted by Shadowcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":380,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque":{"slug":"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque","name":"Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque","icon":"/enemies-icons/Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A special Arts creation from the Dublinn forces, created by their leader Mandragora. According to Mandragora, back when she was studying Originium Arts in an outskirts cemetery, the Tombkeeper Grotesque was her first companion. Its outer appearance has gone through many redesigns, with the latest being based off a Sarkaz from an ancient bloodline. This series of Tombkeepers embodies Mandragora's fury towards Victoria.","abilities":["After first defeat, temporarily transforms into a stone statue with extremely high DEF, then revives as an aerial unit","Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":750,"def":750,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"dublinn_heavy_defender_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_heavy_defender_leader","name":"Dublinn Heavy Defender Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Heavy Defender Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A heavy defender leader in the Dublinn forces, they wield much more sophisticated equipment. The armor technology they use comes from Victoria, while their boots were designed in Leithanien. Their shields look extremely similar to a newly patented product from Kazimierz's Roar Guards Company.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":900,"def":1100,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"dublinn_evocator_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_evocator_leader","name":"Dublinn Evocator Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Evocator Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An evocation caster leader in the Dublinn forces who can control fireballs, they are more adept at using Originium Arts than their underlings. Their leader's teachings reverberate in their minds as they work to purify the corruption of Terra in raging flames.","abilities":["Controls <Purifying Flames> that move along the ground and explode after hitting a melee ally unit, dealing Arts damage and Burn; damage dealt decreases with distance moved"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":0,"def":550,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"tg-s